headers {
  Accept: application/json
  User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0 (monki-trips smoke)
}

docs {
  Smoke collection of the monki-trips API (docs/CONTRACTS.md).

  Every route of the API has one request here; `npm run bruno:coverage`
  fails when a route has none. Requests tagged `smoke` form the post-deploy
  check: health, live, config (CSRF cookie), login, me, create trip, logout.

  Credentials come from the environment, never from this collection:
  SMOKE_EMAIL and SMOKE_PASSWORD (`{{process.env.*}}`). Copy
  environments/local.bru to environments/<name>.local.bru (gitignored) for
  a personal base URL.

  Run the smoke: `bru run --env local --tags smoke` from apps/api/bruno.
}
